e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −5 to +5 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1976","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-pittsburgh-steelers","name":"Pittsburgh Steelers","code":"PIT","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 142)","str":85.9,"squad":[["Terry Bradshaw","QB",86],["Mike Kruczek","QB",77],["Franco Harris","RB",98],["Rocky Bleier","RB",97],["Reggie Harrison","RB",70],["Frank Lewis","WR",82],["Lynn Swann","WR",82],["John Stallworth","WR",76],["Ernie Pough","WR",74],["Larry Brown","TE",73],["Randy Grossman","TE",73],["Jon Kolb","OL",92],["Mike Webster","OL",92],["Gerry Mullins","OL",82],["Sam Davis","OL",78],["Jim Clack","OL",69],["Ray Mansfield","OL",68],["Gordon Gravelle","OL",64],["Joe Greene","DL",90],["Ernie Holmes","DL",88],["L.C. Greenwood","DL",85],["Dwight White","DL",72],["John Banaszak","DL",71],["Steve Furness","DL",69],["Jack Lambert","LB",99],["Jack Ham","LB",98],["Andy Russell","LB",89],["Mel Blount","CB",95],["J.T. Thomas","CB",87],["Jimmy Allen","CB",65],["Glen Edwards","S",99],["Mike Wagner","S",98],["Donnie Shell","S",69],["Roy Gerela","K",82]]},{"id":"nfl-los-angeles-rams","name":"Los Angeles Rams","code":"LAR","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 146)","str":85,"squad":[["Pat Haden","QB",81],["James Harris","QB",73],["Lawrence McCutcheon","RB",94],["John Cappelletti","RB",85],["Ron Jessie","WR",89],["Harold Jackson","WR",87],["Dwight Scales","WR",66],["Tom Geredine","WR",64],["Bob Klein","TE",78],["Terry Nelso